13
00:00:51.117 --> 00:00:53.287
"Do not send me away.

14
00:00:53.288 --> 00:00:57.354
I am your slave, ready to serve you."

15
00:00:57.355 --> 00:01:02.759
"I don’t want a slave," Zeba said, shaking with fear.

16
00:01:02.760 --> 00:01:04.576
